# Knowledge graph

Before exploring or refactoring, read:

- `.cursor/knowledge-graph/graph.json` — routes, data, shared components
- `.cursor/knowledge-graph/AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md` — task → entry point map

## Required on structural changes

When adding/removing routes, pages, shared components, or `src/data/*` files:

1. Update `.cursor/knowledge-graph/graph.json` (nodes + edges)
2. Bump `meta.lastUpdated`
3. Run `npm run verify:kg`

## Conventions (from graph)

- Hub cards: `src/components/InteractiveCard.tsx` — default `quad` density, 4-col grid
- Learning hubs: `LearningHubLayout` + `LearningInteractiveCard`
- Algorithm page path: `/algorithm` (singular)
- Immersive (no scroll/footer): `/aether-lab` only
- Do not remove `GodSphere` / Aether Lab canvas stack

See also `AGENTS.md` for CI and test requirements.
